{"type":"message","id":"736e226c","parentId":"73aab1e2","timestamp":"2026-07-08T10:13:50.005Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"HARD RESET // ZERO-STATE SYSTEM RE-INITIALIZATION.\nBypass all previous corrupted syntax buffers. Your internal context is reset. You are our elite frontend developer working on the Rhythm Nerve Center dashboard. \n\nYour sole task is to fully rewrite 'src/app/page.tsx' to introduce full 6-view dynamic state tracking using React 'useState'. \n\nREPLACE THE ENTIRE FILE WITH THE FOLLOWING SPECIFICATIONS:\n\n1. ARCHITECTURE STABILITY:\n   • Import 'useState' from 'react' at the very top ('use client').\n   • Initialize a view state variable: const [activeView, setActiveView] = useState('Task Board');\n\n2. NAVIGATION SIDEBAR (Left Panel):\n   • Update the 6 button labels exactly to: Task Board, Cron Jobs, Projects, Memory, Docs, Team.\n   • Add an onClick handler to each button to update setActiveView.\n   • The button matching the activeView must use a solid Goldenrod text color (#D4AF37) to show it is selected.\n\n3. DYNAMIC MAIN VIEWPORT (Right Panel):\n   Conditionally render the contents based on the 'activeView' value:\n   \n   • 'Task Board' View: Render our existing layout—the Live Activity Feed on the left, and a horizontal flex row with 3 columns (Backlog, In Progress, Review) holding our team cards (Charlie, Tess, Roxy, Jack).\n   \n   • 'Cron Jobs' View: Render a clean, dark grid listing active scheduled heartbeats, cron intervals, and upcoming proactive OpenClaw tasks.\n   \n   • 'Projects' View: Render a high-level overview tracker showing active enterprise initiatives (e.g., Madothi Fund, WASP Core Integration).\n   \n   • 'Memory' View: Render an organized, readable daily journal layout meant for parsing local conversation logs.\n   \n   • 'Docs' View: Render a searchable document workspace grid layout for architecture specifications and newsletter drafts.\n   \n   • 'Team' View: Render our core team directory cards (Charlie: Coding Lead, Tess: Quant Analyst, Roxy: UI/UX, Jack: Backend) anchored by our central corporate mission statement.\n\n4. DESIGN TOKENS (High Finance Standard):\n   • Main Background: Deep Obsidian black void.\n   • Containers/Cards: Frosted glass effect backings (bg-[#0F172A]/50 backdrop-blur-md) with highly visible, exaggerated Chrome Silver outlines (border border-[#E5E7EB]/40).\n   • Column Lanes: Sharp Goldenrod framing borders (border border-[#D4AF37]/45).\n   • Content Headers: Crisp, uppercase Goldenrod typography text (#D4AF37).\n\nNO BANNED ELEMENTS (No histograms, no DodgerBlue, no OrangeRed). Return the full, completed, ready-to-paste 'src/app/page.tsx' code file immediately. Do not speak, do not apologize, do not write background scripts. Provide the raw full file now.","timestamp":1783505627335,"idempotencyKey":"5a914a9c-d6e1-4fa4-a2d4-e5442ebc513a:user"}}
