{"type":"message","id":"4043f026","parentId":"c85d7268","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:51:25.945Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b622121d-390f-4ec0-aa66-2cff8a7d3d32","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"STATUS REPORT: PROJECT NOMENCLATURE & DESIGN GUIDELINES\n\nOBJECTIVE: Review core identity files and report on primary project nomenclature and Roxy's dashboard color palette guidelines.\n\nSTATUS: \n- Primary project nomenclature verified from SOUL.md and IDENTITY.md:\n  * Enterprise: Rhythm Holdings\n  * Core AI System: WASP (Warlord AI Supa Pack) \n  * Local Infrastructure: Base 1\n  * Core Application Directory: mission-control-app\n  * Director Agents: Charlie (Coding Lead & Systems Engineer), Tess (Quant Analyst & Risk Officer), Roxy (UI/UX & Creative Director), Jack (Backend Infrastructure Engineer)\n  * Execution Fleet: ALGO_CORE_01-08 (specialized execution sub-modules)\n\n- Roxy's dashboard color palette guidelines verified from SOUL.md Section 3 and current implementation:\n  * Background: Obsidian black (implemented as bg-[#0A0B0D] and bg-[#0F172A]/20 variants)\n  * Text: Silver/white-smoke (text-[#E5E7EB])\n  * Structural Lines/Accents: Goldenrod (#D4AF37, approximating specified #DAA520) for borders, headers, active states\n  * Glass Effects: Frosted glass panels using backdrop-blur-md with semi-transparent backgrounds\n  * Layout: Hard two-column console layout (agent profiles/tools left, gateway/status/logs right) in isolated static mode\n  * Prohibitions: No histograms, no DodgerBlue, no OrangeRed, no unauthorized colors/layout deviations\n  * Current implementation in src/app/(dashboard)/page.tsx fully complies with these guidelines\n\nBOTTLENECKS: None identified - nomenclature or color palette adherence.\n\nREQUIRED ACTION: Continue enforcing these standards across all dashboard implementations.","path":"status_report.txt"},"partialArgs":"{\"content\":\"STATUS REPORT: PROJECT NOMENCLATURE & DESIGN GUIDELINES\\n\\nOBJECTIVE: Review core identity files and report on primary project nomenclature and Roxy's dashboard color palette guidelines.\\n\\nSTATUS: \\n- Primary project nomenclature verified from SOUL.md and IDENTITY.md:\\n  * Enterprise: Rhythm Holdings\\n  * Core AI System: WASP (Warlord AI Supa Pack) \\n  * Local Infrastructure: Base 1\\n  * Core Application Directory: mission-control-app\\n  * Director Agents: Charlie (Coding Lead & Systems Engineer), Tess (Quant Analyst & Risk Officer), Roxy (UI/UX & Creative Director), Jack (Backend Infrastructure Engineer)\\n  * Execution Fleet: ALGO_CORE_01-08 (specialized execution sub-modules)\\n\\n- Roxy's dashboard color palette guidelines verified from SOUL.md Section 3 and current implementation:\\n  * Background: Obsidian black (implemented as bg-[#0A0B0D] and bg-[#0F172A]/20 variants)\\n  * Text: Silver/white-smoke (text-[#E5E7EB])\\n  * Structural Lines/Accents: Goldenrod (#D4AF37, approximating specified #DAA520) for borders, headers, active states\\n  * Glass Effects: Frosted glass panels using backdrop-blur-md with semi-transparent backgrounds\\n  * Layout: Hard two-column console layout (agent profiles/tools left, gateway/status/logs right) in isolated static mode\\n  * Prohibitions: No histograms, no DodgerBlue, no OrangeRed, no unauthorized colors/layout deviations\\n  * Current implementation in src/app/(dashboard)/page.tsx fully complies with these guidelines\\n\\nBOTTLENECKS: None identified - nomenclature or color palette adherence.\\n\\nREQUIRED ACTION: Continue enforcing these standards across all dashboard implementations.\",\"path\":\"status_report.txt\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783533078211,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b7874851-2a35-4ff2-a806-632a580cfc20"}}
