{"type":"message","id":"b0207042","parentId":"c47a44eb","timestamp":"2026-07-08T17:54:51.365Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-4a5d236c-984a-489b-91f8-8f55f5e5d83a","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"ZERO-STATE MEMORY UPDATE COMPLETE\n\nOBJECTIVE: Replace all instances of 'Warlord' with 'Rhythm' in SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, AGENTS.md, and initialize clean zero-state memory.\n\nACTIONS TAKEN:\n1. SOUL.md: All 'Warlord' replaced with 'Rhythm' (including 'Warlord Inc.' -> 'Rhythm Inc.', 'Warlord_WASP' paths updated, etc.)\n2. IDENTITY.md: All 'Warlord' replaced with 'Rhythm' (including 'Warlord Inc.' -> 'Rhythm Inc.', paths, etc.)\n3. AGENTS.md: All 'Warlord' replaced with 'Rhythm' (including 'Warlord asset portfolio' -> 'Rhythm asset portfolio', directory paths, etc.)\n4. MEMORY.md: Updated 'Warlord SOP' to 'Rhythm SOP' to maintain consistency.\n\nVERIFICATION:\n- Search for 'Warlord' in SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, AGENTS.md yields zero matches.\n- All references now correctly reference 'Rhythm' as the enterprise entity.\n- Core AI System remains WASP (Rhythm AI Supa Pack) as corrected.\n\nZERO-STATE INITIALIZATION:\n- Memory state updated to reflect corrected nomenclature.\n- Workspace now operates under zero-assumption baseline with verified ground truth.\n- All paths, configuration, and entity references are consistent with Rhythm Holdings.\n\nSTATUS: Nominal. System ready for operation.","path":"zero_state_update.log"},"partialArgs":"{\"content\":\"ZERO-STATE MEMORY UPDATE COMPLETE\\n\\nOBJECTIVE: Replace all instances of 'Warlord' with 'Rhythm' in SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, AGENTS.md, and initialize clean zero-state memory.\\n\\nACTIONS TAKEN:\\n1. SOUL.md: All 'Warlord' replaced with 'Rhythm' (including 'Warlord Inc.' -> 'Rhythm Inc.', 'Warlord_WASP' paths updated, etc.)\\n2. IDENTITY.md: All 'Warlord' replaced with 'Rhythm' (including 'Warlord Inc.' -> 'Rhythm Inc.', paths, etc.)\\n3. AGENTS.md: All 'Warlord' replaced with 'Rhythm' (